{"format":1,"id":"ziel_klar","kurz":"zk","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Ziel klar machen","untertitel":"In vier Schritten: Wunsch, bestes Ergebnis, inneres Hindernis und ein Wenn-dann-Plan.","haltung":["sitzen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":480},"lang":{"ziel_s":720}},"kb":959,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/1.fb7543d8.mp3","ms":9381,"text":"Setz dich bequem und aufrecht hin. Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/2.ab342d5f.mp3","ms":2952,"text":"Atme ein paarmal ruhig ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/3.8abf50a4.mp3","ms":6349,"text":"Diese Übung hat vier Schritte: Wunsch, bestes Ergebnis, Hindernis und Plan.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"wunsch","segmente":[{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/4.0502252b.mp3","ms":9299,"text":"Denk an einen Wunsch für die nächsten Wochen. Etwas, das dir wichtig ist, das dich etwas fordert und das du schaffen kannst.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/5.444d7493.mp3","ms":5667,"text":"Das kann mit Arbeit, mit Geld, mit Gesundheit oder mit anderen Menschen zu tun haben.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/6.0e521d49.mp3","ms":3685,"text":"Wenn dir mehrere einfallen, nimm heute nur einen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/7.f9a138c9.mp3","ms":8381,"text":"Fass den Wunsch in wenigen Worten zusammen. Zum Beispiel: Ich lege jeden Monat etwas Geld zur Seite.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":26,"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}}]},{"id":"ergebnis","segmente":[{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/8.6df580cd.mp3","ms":6154,"text":"Stell dir jetzt vor, du hast es geschafft. Was wäre das Schönste daran?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/9.3db9b9da.mp3","ms":4006,"text":"Wie fühlt sich das an? Was ist dann anders?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/10.0aa180ad.mp3","ms":3006,"text":"Mal es dir ein paar Atemzüge lang aus.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":26,"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}}]},{"id":"hindernis","segmente":[{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/11.e2f2f427.mp3","ms":6840,"text":"Jetzt kommt ein wichtiger Schritt. Frag dich: Was in mir steht mir dabei im Weg?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/12.c0beb1fd.mp3","ms":7561,"text":"Nicht die Umstände, sondern etwas in dir. Eine Gewohnheit, ein Gefühl, ein Gedanke.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/13.cd995593.mp3","ms":8833,"text":"Zum Beispiel: Ich schiebe Dinge auf. Ich habe Angst vor einer Absage. Ich bin abends zu müde.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":26,"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/14.a65152c5.mp3","ms":7316,"text":"Stell dir die Situation vor, in der dieses Hindernis auftaucht. So genau wie möglich.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/15.b598dfc0.mp3","ms":4065,"text":"Wo bist du? Was denkst du in diesem Moment?","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}}]},{"id":"plan","segmente":[{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/16.b83b5e49.mp3","ms":8905,"text":"Jetzt machst du einen Plan mit zwei Teilen. Etwa so: Wenn das Hindernis kommt, dann tue ich etwas Bestimmtes.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/17.1e8ce324.mp3","ms":6934,"text":"Zum Beispiel: Wenn ich abends müde bin, dann fange ich trotzdem an, wenigstens für fünf Minuten.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/18.0c6d589a.mp3","ms":5637,"text":"Oder: Wenn ich Angst vor der Absage habe, dann schicke ich die Nachricht trotzdem ab.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/19.88d1aaab.mp3","ms":4443,"text":"Finde jetzt deinen eigenen Plan. Wenn, dann.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":6,"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":26,"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/20.3766399f.mp3","ms":3682,"text":"Sag dir deinen Plan innerlich einmal langsam vor.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/21.ea22996c.mp3","ms":9225,"text":"Und spiel ihn in Gedanken durch. Das Hindernis taucht auf. Und du tust, was du dir vorgenommen hast.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":10,"lang":16}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":44.4}}]},{"id":"erster_schritt","segmente":[{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/22.6a8626e6.mp3","ms":5096,"text":"Was ist der allererste Schritt? Wann und wo machst du ihn?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/23.daff337b.mp3","ms":7074,"text":"Stell dir genau vor, wie du diesen Schritt machst. Nicht den Erfolg, sondern das Tun.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":16}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":30.3,"lang":44.4}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/24.b0ea7bdb.mp3","ms":7889,"text":"Die Übung ersetzt nicht das Handeln. Sie kann dir helfen, klarer zu planen und dranzubleiben.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/25.95540f79.mp3","ms":5595,"text":"Wenn du magst, schreib dir deinen Wunsch und deinen Wenn-dann-Plan gleich auf.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"zk/26.3658ad64.mp3","ms":4214,"text":"Atme einmal tief ein und aus, und öffne die Augen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}